---
// Wordmark: an ORIGINAL copper disc with a tick (never Mint coin artwork) + the name in the display face.
---
<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Honest Penny home">
  <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="17" fill="#ff9a5c" />
    <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="12.5" fill="none" stroke="#12332e" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.25" />
    <path d="M11.5 18.5l4.5 4.5 8.5-9.5" fill="none" stroke="#12332e" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
  </svg>
  <span>Honest Penny</span>
</a>
<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font: 800 1.45rem/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.03em; min-height: 44px; }
  .logo:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  .logo:hover span { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
</style>
